Package: sheepdog
Title: Sample, Validate and Calibrate 'BirdNET' Detections
Version: 3.2.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo B.", "Provete", , "dbprovete@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to check whether automated detections from 'BirdNET'
    custom classifiers in passive acoustic monitoring are real. The package
    builds clip sets for manual validation (top-score, random-occasion or
    random-recording designs), summarises the reviewed clips, calibrates
    confidence scores into probabilities of true detection with
    hierarchical logistic models, and turns calibrated detections into
    nightly detection histories and effort-standardised community
    matrices.
